  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"חלק של עוגה, מלקחיים וקלח תירס\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhCviT5UFyWWuJTLtlVtiUyEdrl3KNmWv82BhTjqRjLMIpbX-Z0jHyCmcRbojl9fggPrKCgLWQseoXFdHLGfmGGcC-O9MCgwllm5z9Ezir8TScRxW2PEwVxbV6Q-41pUXJ5SKOwr1FJx3G0flJynkswQ_MKVJHT2rT2MUw_jf-kNNE9RfyWkMliZL8p2nk/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-08-11T201434.358.jpeg\" width=\"320\" /></p><h2 style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: center; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">כשהשפה מושכת אותנו לקחת חלק ולתת לקח</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲשֶׁר חָלַק ה אֱלֹקיךָ אֹתָם</span></blockquote><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"color: #212121; font-size: large; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"></p><p style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🍰 </span></span><span data-end=\"166\" data-start=\"157\"><b>חֵלֶק </b>הוא מה שנוצר&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">כאשר&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><b>מְחַלְּקִים</b></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">&nbsp;משהו פיזי - כגון עוגה</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🧩 </span>אפשר&nbsp;<b>לָקַחַת</b>&nbsp;כל <b>חֵלֶק&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">בפני עצמו - כמו פאזל שמתפרק לחתיכות.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">🏬 בשוק, ה<b>לָקוֹחוֹת</b>&nbsp;<b>לוֹקְחִים&nbsp;</b>סחורה - לפעמים את כולה, לפעמים רק את <b>חֶלְקָהּ</b>.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🌽 </span>כל <b>קֶלַח&nbsp;</b>תירס -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">מהווה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><b>חֵלֶק</b></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><b>&nbsp;</b>(יחידה) נפרד.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">🗡️ בצבא, תנועת&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">מֶלְקָחַיִם</b><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"> נעשית כשמכתרים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">עיר משני צדדים - לקוחים את המטרה מכל כיוון</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🤐  </span></span><b style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">חָלוּק</b><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"> נסגר&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">בכפתורים או ברוכסן - לשני חלקים יש נקודת חיבור</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">👨‍🦲 יעקב נקרא איש&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">חָלָק&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">בגלל שכל&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">חֶלְקֵי</b><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">&nbsp;גופו שווים (זהים) - ללא שערות. (עפ\"י אבן עזרא)&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">🧊 גם משטח&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">חָלָק</b><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"> שאינו מחוספס או&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">מְחֻלָּק</b><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">, נחשב שלם ו</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">אחיד</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">⛸️ </span>מדרון <b>חֲלַקְלַק</b></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">&nbsp;מסוכן - מי שמעד עלול <b>לְהִתְחַלֵּק</b> לאיברים...</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🚿 </span>המים <b>קוֹלְחִים </b>מראש הַ<b>מִּקְלַחַת</b>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">בַּ</span><b style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">חֲלָקִים</b><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"> (סילונים)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">נפרדים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">💎 לקיחת&nbsp;<span><b>חֵלֶק</b></span><span><b>&nbsp;</b></span>בתורה - נקראת&nbsp;<b>לֶקַח&nbsp;</b>טוב - מתוך השלמות האינסופית.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"font-size: large; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">משפט מסכם:</span></h3></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>מַחְלֹקֶת</b> נוצרת בגין <b>חִלּוּקֵי</b> דעות אוֹדוֹת מושג מופשט, כגון דעה פוליטית.&nbsp;כָּל צַד <b>לוֹקֵחַ חֵלֶק</b> (<b>לֶקַח</b>) לְעַצְמוֹ, וּמְנַסֶּה לְלַמֵּד <b>לֶקַח</b> אֶת יְרִיבוֹ.</span><br />"
}
